{{exampleQueries}}

User query:
{{query}}

Return JSON with this shape:
{
  "canonicalQuery": "...",
  "intent": "path|funds_in_theme|companies_linked|companies_invested_by_fund|companies_funded_by_both|search",
  "confidence": 0.0,
  "rationale": "..."
}
